                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "Ten badges on you and you still descend the obsidian stair. The Descent honors that - it lets the strong come back down and burn. Cinderstrike will meet you on this stair as often as you dare it."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "My Turtonator has been waiting for a rematch worth the ash. Bring the champion team down whenever you want the fire. The stair is always lit."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Drakar - the stair stays lit",
                    Label: "rematch_ready"
                },
