                    ],
                    Texts: [
                        {
                            Text: "The obsidian stair drops in a straight glassy line and I stand its head - you were lit against the glow the whole way down. I hold this stair so the leader below never fights anyone soft. Warm up on my fire."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "My Centiskorch wraps a team and does not let go. This deep in the Descent, the near-last wall, you fight me full or you do not fight the leader at all."
                        },
                        {
                            Text: "You wear the founder-face the sealed Scorchspire files kept behind a black bar. On the stair I do not care whose ghost you are - I care how you burn."
                        }
                    ],
                    Name: "Drakar Cinderstrike",
                    Label: "default"
                }
